         "## How it works",
         "Panel members will hear from planners, developers, environmental groups and residents' associations, and visit 5 possible sites, from Temple Quarter to Lockleaze.",
         "They will then vote. The council has promised a written reply to every recommendation within 3 months, including an explanation for any it rejects.",
         "## Doubts",
         "Not everyone is convinced.",
